  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-only\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Middletown, New Jersey · Wedding photography</p><h1>Elaina &amp; James<br><em>Jacques Reception Center</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Elaina and James’s wedding at Jacques Reception Center, photographed by GioLina.</p></header><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">In the garden and by the fire.</h2><p>Courtyard portraits, autumn leaves and quiet moments beside the fireplace.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Elaina &amp; James\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-ca96038316eed514.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James together beneath an outdoor arch\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-ca96038316eed514-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-ca96038316eed514-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-ca96038316eed514.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James together beneath an outdoor arch\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-cc71c348e7272f2c.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James raising their glasses in a black and white portrait\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-cc71c348e7272f2c-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-cc71c348e7272f2c-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-cc71c348e7272f2c.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James raising their glasses in a black and white portrait\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-ca72cb4c8e1c5c72.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James kissing in the courtyard at dusk\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-ca72cb4c8e1c5c72-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-ca72cb4c8e1c5c72-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-ca72cb4c8e1c5c72.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James kissing in the courtyard at dusk\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-66da0bf5ac3893a5.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View James kissing Elaina on the cheek beside the courtyard gates\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-66da0bf5ac3893a5-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-66da0bf5ac3893a5-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-66da0bf5ac3893a5.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"James kissing Elaina on the cheek beside the courtyard gates\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-a38b8fdb4d8dd342.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James embracing in front of the iron gates\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-a38b8fdb4d8dd342-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-a38b8fdb4d8dd342-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-a38b8fdb4d8dd342.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James embracing in front of the iron gates\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-04813a2105b1a523.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina in a bridal portrait beside the gates\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-04813a2105b1a523-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-04813a2105b1a523-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-04813a2105b1a523.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"800\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/1199\" alt=\"Elaina in a bridal portrait beside the gates\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-7edbde3842edc1f4.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James sharing a kiss beneath red autumn leaves\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-7edbde3842edc1f4-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-7edbde3842edc1f4-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-7edbde3842edc1f4.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James sharing a kiss beneath red autumn leaves\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-7c368aac5cd3cd58.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James smiling together in the garden\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-7c368aac5cd3cd58-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-7c368aac5cd3cd58-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-7c368aac5cd3cd58.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James smiling together in the garden\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-874bc290a9a5658e.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina seated beside a stone fireplace\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-874bc290a9a5658e-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-874bc290a9a5658e-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-874bc290a9a5658e.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"800\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/1199\" alt=\"Elaina seated beside a stone fireplace\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-f2f8fc5daa145b62.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Elaina and James posing together beside the fireplace\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-f2f8fc5daa145b62-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-f2f8fc5daa145b62-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-f2f8fc5daa145b62.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"Elaina and James posing together beside the fireplace\"></a></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Middletown</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">Jacques Reception Center</h2></div><div><p>Jacques Reception Center is in Middletown, New Jersey. This story features GioLina’s photography for Elaina and James.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://www.jacquescatering.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at Jacques Reception Center</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/the-park-savoy-florham-park/\">Deanna &amp; Anthony at The Park Savoy</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script>",
